*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server
!server/**
!public
!public/**
# the operator CLI rides in the image for the scheduled sweep job; the Cloud Shell blocks and the deploy helper do not.
# `!scripts` is needed for `!scripts/*.mjs` to work under both builders — but it also re-includes the whole directory,
# since Docker matches a pattern against every parent path and the last matching pattern wins. So the two lines after
# it exclude the shell scripts again: the Cloud Shell blocks and deploy-staging.sh name project ids, accounts and
# secret names, and belong to the owner's terminal, not to a container reachable from the internet.
!scripts
!scripts/*.mjs
scripts/cloudshell
scripts/*.sh
